	('8c3e081e-360a-4675-8ac1-22d96ea246ec', 'Many marriages fail not because love was absent, but because ___ was missing.', '51e70f96-af0c-4199-b816-f2d30ac593c1'),
	('5edc997d-caf9-43d7-8f41-79e6a27a70c9', 'The course describes this as “a single, joyful day,” while marriage is called “a lifelong journey.”', '51e70f96-af0c-4199-b816-f2d30ac593c1'),
	('d7c2051a-124b-45b5-b3f2-e0c2beb8270b', 'The Four Pillars of Personal Readiness are emotional, financial, relational, and ___.', '51e70f96-af0c-4199-b816-f2d30ac593c1'),
	('13feaf25-027f-40b8-9923-66d104466bf2', 'Session III teaches that marriage is best understood as a covenant rather than a:', '51e70f96-af0c-4199-b816-f2d30ac593c1'),
	('03167e30-e904-4b84-a87e-ac98056b748a', 'Which option correctly orders the Four-Word Love Continuum?', '51e70f96-af0c-4199-b816-f2d30ac593c1'),
	('8f08657c-5dc6-47f1-86a6-bf8d17521ecf', 'The Three Dimensions of a Healthy Marriage are emotional connection, practical partnership, and:', '51e70f96-af0c-4199-b816-f2d30ac593c1'),
	('52f055d0-ccc9-47e3-8556-c73d60ea5cfe', '“Everyone of my age is already married” is given as an example of which cause of marital struggle?', '51e70f96-af0c-4199-b816-f2d30ac593c1'),
	('5072f540-d403-459d-8bb9-713aeecc6bb0', 'Readiness for marriage is best described in the course as:', '51e70f96-af0c-4199-b816-f2d30ac593c1'),
	('0761be2b-fe71-486f-990b-281365e68b1a', 'Infatuation is described in the course as intense early-stage excitement that:', '51e70f96-af0c-4199-b816-f2d30ac593c1'),
	('92820569-e2e8-43de-a495-2f588147a1c4', 'The Key Lesson of Session I teaches that a wedding can be planned in months, while a marriage is prepared:', '51e70f96-af0c-4199-b816-f2d30ac593c1'),
	('68df1cd4-5eaf-45ef-ba6c-797f343f42d8', 'According to Session I, what determines whether a couple can build a life together, more than charm or chemistry?', '1a5ad61a-e46c-48f8-955b-1ba486e533a3'),
	('773f7222-a26b-4c72-96b0-28bf7faab6d8', 'True compatibility, as defined in Session II, means:', '1a5ad61a-e46c-48f8-955b-1ba486e533a3'),
	('b94cbe7e-e58c-49d8-9987-8194f1c7f632', 'The Five Compatibility Areas are values, emotional, communication, financial, and:', '1a5ad61a-e46c-48f8-955b-1ba486e533a3'),
	('36a1aaa4-9378-407d-b16e-d8ed6790416b', 'In the Glossary, a “red flag” is best described as:', '1a5ad61a-e46c-48f8-955b-1ba486e533a3'),
	('3eed7e40-9a45-4e8b-aca4-64420a704c91', 'According to Session III, why is it wise to invite a trusted outside person into evaluating a serious relationship?', '1a5ad61a-e46c-48f8-955b-1ba486e533a3'),
	('8b2551ae-23d5-4385-a256-01952b1e2a14', 'In Session IV, the healthiest response to conflicting family expectations is:', '1a5ad61a-e46c-48f8-955b-1ba486e533a3'),
	('85b1ed30-7c1f-4cda-9800-f9974fd3c5a4', 'A “green flag” example listed in the course includes a partner who:', '1a5ad61a-e46c-48f8-955b-1ba486e533a3'),
	('2e77b75f-6852-4942-b5cb-a9de9ba70273', 'According to Session I, wise partner selection requires you to first:', '1a5ad61a-e46c-48f8-955b-1ba486e533a3'),
	('37c8bb82-ac09-4e6d-8f0b-6e3fce457fe3', 'The course teaches that differences most likely to “collide” in a relationship are those rooted in:', '1a5ad61a-e46c-48f8-955b-1ba486e533a3'),
	('1007e14e-03b9-4dcd-b24f-a0d7c7a68d71', 'Day 2, Session IV, encourages families to be part of:', '1a5ad61a-e46c-48f8-955b-1ba486e533a3'),
	('d057ef0e-e6f4-4614-a976-fbce9fe7023d', 'Emotional intelligence in marriage is the ability to recognise, understand, and manage emotions, and to:', 'c86fd914-2b26-4b86-9c45-7bdad9f75218'),
	('a28a99f3-970f-47ec-86a6-f148ae6208d1', 'According to Session I, genuine emotional regulation means:', 'c86fd914-2b26-4b86-9c45-7bdad9f75218'),
	('cbd4bfa3-8ea3-4095-b315-fff1704993c4', 'The course states that most marriages are worn down more by years of feeling unheard than by:', 'c86fd914-2b26-4b86-9c45-7bdad9f75218'),
	('4e57e9e7-cc64-4175-9d33-23f8c34822c1', 'Active listening, as described in Session II, means:', 'c86fd914-2b26-4b86-9c45-7bdad9f75218'),
	('5fb35810-eacd-4819-bcd1-619c4063a850', 'According to Session III, what predicts relationship breakdown more than conflict itself?', 'c86fd914-2b26-4b86-9c45-7bdad9f75218'),
	('807a6d9a-4956-43c3-9187-daa035ec7e48', 'Forgiveness, in a lasting marriage, is best understood as:', 'c86fd914-2b26-4b86-9c45-7bdad9f75218'),
	('80e40e7b-076f-4fe4-a28f-731875d7219a', 'Session III describes this as the skill that matters more than avoiding conflict altogether:', 'c86fd914-2b26-4b86-9c45-7bdad9f75218'),
	('210c74cc-c236-4a54-a83e-3a7dbb9455a3', 'Trust, according to Session IV, is built through:', 'c86fd914-2b26-4b86-9c45-7bdad9f75218'),
	('fef94140-9bbf-4d9e-a7dc-0a9c3e077b1b', 'The course teaches that healthy intimacy grows safely only where ___ is already present.', 'c86fd914-2b26-4b86-9c45-7bdad9f75218'),
	('19fb0980-77b8-4abc-9cda-4bd51897a737', 'A constructive way to raise a disagreement, per the Fair-Conflict Framework, is to use:', 'c86fd914-2b26-4b86-9c45-7bdad9f75218'),
	('8449e7c2-3f4d-45e5-92cb-386797bbeb17', 'According to Session I, many marriages struggle financially not from a lack of love, but from:', '5b26f65a-89f5-4b25-b941-593393205e82'),
	('da6ecfa6-0dd1-4882-b0a9-eb598cdb2459', 'The course states that financial secrecy after marriage is:', '5b26f65a-89f5-4b25-b941-593393205e82'),
	('12a6e7d1-a263-43db-bf31-7589e56fe6e4', 'Household tension, according to Session II, usually comes from:', '5b26f65a-89f5-4b25-b941-593393205e82'),
	('15f23e0c-4ebe-45d0-8da3-02b27f30b56f', 'The course recommends that household roles should be:', '5b26f65a-89f5-4b25-b941-593393205e82'),
	('9694f84f-c85e-4c38-a04a-5faeaa997cd8', 'Healthy boundaries with extended family, per Session III, are meant to:', '5b26f65a-89f5-4b25-b941-593393205e82'),
	('6ba73271-2fe0-43b9-83f6-ad7db9504a58', 'According to Session III, who should communicate a boundary to a partner''s own family?', '5b26f65a-89f5-4b25-b941-593393205e82'),
	('beaedae4-f56b-4190-9b01-4f180fec93ae', 'In the Glossary, a Family Vision Statement is defined as:', '5b26f65a-89f5-4b25-b941-593393205e82'),
	('a851c84c-3141-4840-958d-d9328c017876', 'SMART goals, as taught in Session IV, must be Specific, Measurable, Achievable, Relevant, and:', '5b26f65a-89f5-4b25-b941-593393205e82'),
	('8c0a5168-b7dd-4216-a27d-9e642e581a29', 'According to Session I, differing “money personalities” between partners become a problem mainly when:', '5b26f65a-89f5-4b25-b941-593393205e82'),
	('b2504583-9882-4985-af62-d7e320e30e25', 'The course recommends couples build a simple, protected ritual to keep their shared vision alive, especially during:', '5b26f65a-89f5-4b25-b941-593393205e82'),
	('d6c05377-562e-46db-91f5-0b57233c41cd', 'Responsible parenting, per Session I, spans four connected duties: physical, emotional, moral, and:', '901c0e08-a894-479f-93fc-2a3e080ef2eb'),
	('c927d379-9865-479e-b484-a45150a36504', 'The course states that parenting readiness actually begins:', '901c0e08-a894-479f-93fc-2a3e080ef2eb'),
	('f140bf14-fa38-4a46-8d05-ebd675e8e176', 'According to Session II, many parenting frustrations come from a mismatch between parental expectation and:', '901c0e08-a894-479f-93fc-2a3e080ef2eb'),
	('684a432e-5aeb-4160-bad8-0aa9f24eae58', 'Effective discipline, per Session II, is less about punishment and more about:', '901c0e08-a894-479f-93fc-2a3e080ef2eb'),
	('63a40788-4c52-484b-b18f-6b462fa1e5c9', 'The Four Dimensions of Child Development are physical, cognitive, emotional, and:', '901c0e08-a894-479f-93fc-2a3e080ef2eb'),
	('199b3cf6-b28d-4a9a-a30c-9e70a4f622e0', 'According to Session III, family breakdown rarely results from:', '901c0e08-a894-479f-93fc-2a3e080ef2eb'),
	('38bbad90-8f7d-4376-a365-5c5fec1a3e53', 'The course teaches that even after children arrive, couples should continue to invest directly in:', '901c0e08-a894-479f-93fc-2a3e080ef2eb'),
	('90c98be9-6566-4cae-8413-3dbae661a997', 'A protective habit against financial-stress-driven breakdown, listed in Session III, is:', '901c0e08-a894-479f-93fc-2a3e080ef2eb'),
	('3e014d9c-cc9a-4f98-97a9-6d1f5af475ce', 'The Final Declaration recited at Graduation begins, “I refuse to enter marriage and parenting...”', '901c0e08-a894-479f-93fc-2a3e080ef2eb'),
	('a16a7bce-528b-4534-9e90-cb5d323b842f', 'According to Day 5''s closing message, the value of the five days will be measured by:', '901c0e08-a894-479f-93fc-2a3e080ef2eb');
