</p>"}', 'Online', NULL, NULL, NULL, '["Thousands of qualified graduates compete for the same opportunities, and employers now assess personality, communication, and adaptability as closely as qualifications. Without a deliberate professional identity and a habit of continuous growth, talented people stay overlooked, underpaid, and stuck exactly where they started."]', 'cmp8kn4u80001lcpdkabi1nhf'),
	('Strategic Public Speaking Skills', 'strategic-public-speaking-skills', 'Brilliant ideas stay invisible when fear keeps you silent. This 5-day intensive trains you to speak with structure, confidence, and conviction, planning powerful messages, controlling voice and stage presence, and persuading ethically, so your best thinking finally reaches the room, the interview, and the platform it deserves.', '/uploads/1790378439000-jiq2da.png', true, '2026-09-25 23:23:30.306', '2026-11-03 20:05:52.268', 'c9c013cc-3f07-4094-bb25-87563a17a4a7', '3e4ce107-02f9-4c65-b0f1-d49aa2939dac', 0, NULL, '5 days', true, true, 'BEGINNER', 0.00, 0, '["University Students & Recent Graduates","Young Professionals & Junior Staff","Entrepreneurs & Business Owners","Managers & Team Leaders","Community & Youth Leaders","Anyone Who Freezes or Avoids Speaking in Public"]', '["Communicate strategically, planning messages with clear purpose and audience","Structure and design a powerful, well-organized speech","Apply storytelling deliberately to move people to action","Control voice, body language, and stage presence with confidence","Persuade ethically using credibility, emotion, and logic together","Communicate as a leader during vision-casting, change, and crisis","Handle difficult questions, hostile audiences, and media exposure"]', '["<p>Brilliant ideas stay invisible when fear keeps you silent. This 5-day intensive trains you to speak with structure, confidence, and conviction, planning powerful messages, controlling voice and stage presence, and persuading ethically, so your best thinking finally reaches the room, the interview, and the platform it deserves.</p>"]', 'Online', NULL, NULL, NULL, '["Opportunity increasingly finds the person who can be heard, in an interview, a pitch, or a crisis. Yet most people leave education having written essays but never having been taught to speak one. Left unaddressed, speaking fear keeps real talent invisible and unheard."]', 'cmp8kn4u80001lcpdkabi1nhf'),
	('Marriage Preparation and Parenting Readiness', 'marriage-preparation-and-parenting-readiness', 'Strong feelings aren''t enough to build a lasting marriage or raise a healthy family. This 5-day intensive equips you with the self-awareness, communication skills, and practical tools to choose a partner wisely, build emotional maturity, and prepare confidently for the realities of marriage and parenting, before the challenges arrive.', '/uploads/1790782447736-7qz88s.png', true, '2026-09-30 15:34:26.95', '2026-11-03 20:06:10.341', 'e5b94836-14b9-4dbb-b006-7773486257e9', '3e4ce107-02f9-4c65-b0f1-d49aa2939dac', 0, NULL, '5 days', true, true, 'INTERMEDIATE', 0.00, 0, '["Engaged Couples Preparing for Marriage","Young Adults Considering Marriage","University Students & Graduates","Newly Married Couples","Individuals Seeking Clarity Before Their Next Relationship","Parents, Mentors & Community Leaders Supporting Couples"]', '["Distinguish attraction, infatuation, love, and genuine commitment","Evaluate a potential partner using values-based red-flag and green-flag tools","Build emotional intelligence, communication, and conflict-resolution skills","Navigate financial planning and shared responsibility as a couple","Resolve conflict and practice forgiveness within a relationship","Understand core parenting responsibilities and child development basics","Design a shared family vision, roadmap, and lifelong commitment plan"]', '["<p>Strong feelings aren&#039;t enough to build a lasting marriage or raise a healthy family. This 5-day intensive equips you with the self-awareness, communication skills, and practical tools to choose a partner wisely, build emotional maturity, and prepare confidently for the realities of marriage and parenting, before the challenges arrive.</p>"]', 'Hybrid', NULL, NULL, NULL, '{"Most relationships don''t fail from a single event, they erode from unpreparedness, poor communication, and emotional immaturity. As family instability rises, the ability to choose wisely, communicate honestly, and plan together determines whether love becomes a lasting foundation or a quiet disappointment."}', 'cmp8kn4u80001lcpdkabi1nhf'),
	('Conflict Resolution and Problem Solving', 'conflict-resolution-and-problem-solving', 'Disagreement, tension, and stalled decisions cost trust, time, and results. This 5-day intensive equips you to diagnose conflict accurately, communicate under pressure, negotiate without damaging relationships, and solve problems strategically, transforming friction into stronger teams, families, and organizations.', '/uploads/1790381867958-xkm97f.png', true, '2026-09-26 00:28:33.417', '2026-11-03 20:05:58.754', 'cc7f9116-e78a-42c9-90e2-b1501c79ee23', '3e4ce107-02f9-4c65-b0f1-d49aa2939dac', 0, NULL, '5 days', true, true, 'BEGINNER', 0.00, 0, '["Managers & Team Leaders","Human Resources & Organizational Development Professionals","Entrepreneurs & Business Owners","Community, Faith & Institutional Leaders","Public & Development Sector Professionals","Young Professionals & University Graduates"]', '["Analyze conflict systematically using stakeholder, power, and root-cause tools","Distinguish positions from underlying interests, needs, and values","Communicate assertively and navigate difficult conversations with confidence","Evaluate problems strategically using SWOT, PESTLE, and sound decision models","Design systems that prevent conflict before it escalates","Lead with fairness, courage, and accountability under pressure"]', '["<p>Disagreement, tension, and stalled decisions cost trust, time, and results. This 5-day intensive equips you to diagnose conflict accurately, communicate under pressure, negotiate without damaging relationships, and solve problems strategically, transforming friction into stronger teams, families, and organizations.</p>"]', 'Online', NULL, NULL, NULL, '["Conflict is unavoidable, but most people were never taught to handle it well, only to avoid it, fight it, or fear it. Teams lose their best people, families drift apart, and problems resurface in new disguises. Mastering resolution and strategic problem-solving turns friction into trust, growth, and lasting results."]', 'cmp8kn4u80001lcpdkabi1nhf'),
	('Nonviolent Communication', 'nonviolent-communication', 'Most people fight without meaning to, through blame, criticism, or silence they never chose consciously. This 5-day intensive teaches you to observe without judging, feel without being ruled by feeling, and ask for what you need without demanding it, transforming how you connect at home, at work, and in every relationship that matters.', '/uploads/1790776509093-46l43p.png', true, '2026-09-30 13:55:49.336', '2026-11-03 20:06:06.622', '8223fb67-ad04-4c01-b6d4-5ae72802cecb', '3e4ce107-02f9-4c65-b0f1-d49aa2939dac', 0, NULL, '5 days', true, true, 'BEGINNER', 0.00, 0, '["University Students & Young Professionals","Managers & Team Leaders","Parents, Couples & Families","Educators & Youth Workers","Community, Faith & Institutional Leaders","Anyone Facing Recurring Conflict or Disconnection in Relationships"]', '["Distinguish observation from judgment, and feeling from blame","Build an honest vocabulary of feelings and universal human needs","Communicate requests clearly without demanding or coercing","Navigate conflict with compassion instead of avoidance or aggression","Practice empathic listening in high-stakes and everyday conversations","Apply compassionate communication in families, teams, and leadership","Develop a personal, daily practice for honest, respectful connection"]', '["<p>Most people fight without meaning to, through blame, criticism, or silence they never chose consciously. This 5-day intensive teaches you to observe without judging, feel without being ruled by feeling, and ask for what you need without demanding it, transforming how you connect at home, at work, and in every relationship that matters.</p>"]', 'Online', NULL, NULL, NULL, '["Too many relationships break down not from a lack of love, but from a lack of language, words shaped by fear and old habits instead of honesty. Learning to speak and listen with compassion replaces distance and resentment with trust, turning everyday conversations into real connection."]', 'cmp8kn4u80001lcpdkabi1nhf');


